{"id": "gaokao_math_2025_henan_874_06", "answer": "A", "raw_response": "根据题意，设视风风速向量为 $\\vec{v}_{app}$，真风风速向量为 $\\vec{v}_{true}$，船速向量为 $\\vec{v}_{boat}$。\n由题意可知：$\\vec{v}_{app} = \\vec{v}_{true} + \\vec{v}_{ship\\_wind}$，且 $\\vec{v}_{ship\\_wind} = -\\vec{v}_{boat}$。\n所以 $\\vec{v}_{true} = \\vec{v}_{app} + \\vec{v}_{boat}$。\n\n由图2可知：\n$\\vec{v}_{app} = (0-3, 2-3) = (-3, -1)$\n$\\vec{v}_{boat} = (3-2, 3-0) = (1, 3)$\n\n则真风风速向量为：\n$\\vec{v}_{true} = (-3, -1) + (1, 3) = (-2, 2)$\n\n真风风速的大小为：\n$|\\vec{v}_{true}| = \\sqrt{(-2)^2 + 2^2} = \\sqrt{8} = 2\\sqrt{2}$\n\n因为 $\\sqrt{4} < \\sqrt{8} < \\sqrt{9}$，即 $2 < 2\\sqrt{2} < 3$。\n更精确地，$2\\sqrt{2} \\approx 2.828$。\n\n查表可知，风速大小在 $1.1 \\sim 3.3$ m/s 之间属于“轻风”。\n故真风为轻风。\n\n<answer>A</answer>", "model": "qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 639, "completion_tokens": 1697, "total_tokens": 2336, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1335, "text_tokens": 362}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"image_tokens": 373, "text_tokens": 266}}, "choice_mode": "single", "evaluation_protocol": "choice_aware_v2"}
{"id": "gaokao_math_2025_henan_874_07", "answer": "B", "raw_response": "圆心坐标为 $E(0, -2)$，半径为 $r$。\n直线方程为 $\\sqrt{3}x - y + 2 = 0$。\n圆心到直线的距离 $d = \\frac{|0 - (-2) + 2|}{\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3})^2 + (-1)^2}} = \\frac{4}{2} = 2$。\n\n圆上到直线距离为1的点，即为圆与距离已知直线为1的两条平行线的交点。\n这两条平行线到圆心的距离分别为 $d_1 = |d - 1| = |2 - 1| = 1$ 和 $d_2 = d + 1 = 2 + 1 = 3$。\n\n设圆与这两条平行线的交点个数分别为 $n_1$ 和 $n_2$。\n- 对于距离为1的平行线：\n  - 当 $r < 1$ 时，$n_1 = 0$；\n  - 当 $r = 1$ 时，$n_1 = 1$；\n  - 当 $r > 1$ 时，$n_1 = 2$。\n- 对于距离为3的平行线：\n  - 当 $r < 3$ 时，$n_2 = 0$；\n  - 当 $r = 3$ 时，$n_2 = 1$；\n  - 当 $r > 3$ 时，$n_2 = 2$。\n\n题目要求交点总数为2，即 $n_1 + n_2 = 2$。\n- 若 $0 < r < 1$，则 $n_1=0, n_2=0$，总数0。\n- 若 $r = 1$，则 $n_1=1, n_2=0$，总数1。\n- 若 $1 < r < 3$，则 $n_1=2, n_2=0$，总数2。符合题意。\n- 若 $r = 3$，则 $n_1=2, n_2=1$，总数3。\n- 若 $r > 3$，则 $n_1=2, n_2=2$，总数4。\n\n故 $r$ 的取值范围是 $(1, 3)$。\n\n<answer>B</answer>", "model": "qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 346, "completion_tokens": 4506, "total_tokens": 4852, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3950, "text_tokens": 556}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"image_tokens": 158, "text_tokens": 188}}, "choice_mode": "single", "evaluation_protocol": "choice_aware_v2"}
